WEBVTT

00:02.401 --> 00:04.731
shinjitai
I want to believe

00:04.831 --> 00:07.891
ano hi mitsuketa hikari
In the light that I found that day

00:08.371 --> 00:11.111
kimi to kawashita
Because I still have

00:11.111 --> 00:15.771
tatta hitotsuno yakusoku ga arukara
That one promise that I made to you

00:16.181 --> 00:23.171
mou tachidomarazuni aruite yukitai
I want to keep walking, never stopping

00:24.891 --> 00:27.761
Dragon Drive

00:27.761 --> 00:33.281
uresugita kajitsu wo kajiru youni
Like biting into an overripe fruit

00:33.391 --> 00:36.361
yowai jibun ni
I was spoiling myself

00:36.361 --> 00:39.631
amaetsuzukete ita
I was giving in to my weakness

00:40.101 --> 00:44.471
kimi ni deawanakereba
If I hadn't met you

00:44.471 --> 00:46.441
ima mo
I'd still...

00:46.441 --> 00:52.781
kabe wo kowasu koto nado dekinakatta yo
...be unable to break the walls around me

00:54.481 --> 00:56.851
wasurenai
I'll never forget

00:56.851 --> 01:00.081
ano hi kanjita itami
The pain that I felt that day

01:00.391 --> 01:05.391
nido to ano basho modoritakunai
I never want to go back to that place

01:05.391 --> 01:06.981
motto tsuyoku
This strong feeling

01:07.091 --> 01:09.501
shinjitai
I want to believe

01:09.501 --> 01:12.661
ano hi mitsuketa hikari
In the light I found that day

01:13.031 --> 01:18.111
kakkowarui to warawaretemo ii
Let them laugh and call me a loser

01:18.111 --> 01:20.841
bukiyou dakara
Because I'm clumsy

01:20.841 --> 01:28.541
onaji ikikata shika erabenainda
I can only choose to live life this way

01:41.201 --> 01:42.721
It's not just Kyoji.

01:43.031 --> 01:44.931
Sayaka's also participating
in the tournament.

01:45.071 --> 01:47.661
Wh-What's that girl doing here?!

01:48.241 --> 01:50.741
What's that? Do you guys know them?

01:50.741 --> 01:51.511
Yeah.

01:51.511 --> 01:52.571
I see.

01:52.571 --> 01:55.441
So they came here
from the same world as Reiji.

01:55.811 --> 01:59.681
Reiji. I've been waiting for this moment.

02:00.151 --> 02:03.671
Kyoji. I can't afford to lose to you.

02:03.821 --> 02:05.491
I will not lose!

02:05.491 --> 02:07.181
I cannot afford to lose!

02:07.551 --> 02:09.681
Let's do it! Sayaka! Kyoji!

02:11.591 --> 02:14.691
Winner and Loser

02:31.981 --> 02:33.411
Hey, Maiko?!

02:34.451 --> 02:36.221
I'll go first!

02:36.221 --> 02:37.711
I'm not gonna lose!

02:39.551 --> 02:41.581
Yeah, go and get 'em, girl.

02:41.761 --> 02:44.021
Go ahead and clean up those underlings!

02:44.291 --> 02:45.761
You don't need to tell me that!

02:47.791 --> 02:48.901
Sayaka, Kyoji.

02:48.901 --> 02:51.021
You go ahead and take care of them.

02:51.271 --> 02:52.831
You heard him, Sayaka.

02:52.831 --> 02:53.731
Go ahead.

02:53.731 --> 02:55.501
Huh? I'm going first?

02:55.801 --> 02:58.401
I'm only interested in fighting
against Reiji Ohzora.

02:58.571 --> 03:01.471
If you don't want to fight,
come here and let me cuddle up to you.

03:01.811 --> 03:04.071
Okay, you've convinced me.

03:04.341 --> 03:06.511
I'll fight them as you wish.

03:08.181 --> 03:10.581
Here I go, Princess!

03:13.791 --> 03:17.251
So Kyoji and Sayaka are here in Rikyu, too.

03:17.961 --> 03:19.121
What a surprise.

03:19.361 --> 03:20.861
No sweat.

03:20.861 --> 03:23.891
Whichever team wins,
they're still no match for us.

03:43.121 --> 03:44.481
Come on!

03:44.791 --> 03:47.051
Why do you keep running away?!

03:47.051 --> 03:48.681
It's hardly a match the way you're fighting!

03:48.921 --> 03:52.831
I dislike savage acts like fighting...

03:52.831 --> 03:54.321
...unlike you.

03:54.561 --> 03:56.321
What did you say?!

04:02.571 --> 04:05.211
I can no longer continue
playing around with you.

04:05.211 --> 04:07.671
Put her to sleep, Floralfoehn!

04:13.351 --> 04:14.751
Wha...

04:20.321 --> 04:22.121
I'm so sleepy.

04:22.391 --> 04:24.251
Get lots of rest.

04:24.491 --> 04:26.481
I'm sure you must be exhausted.

04:30.161 --> 04:32.631
Th... This kind... of attack...

04:33.631 --> 04:36.361
...has no effect on Gholaoh and me!

04:45.281 --> 04:47.941
I'm not gonna lose, no matter what!

04:55.691 --> 04:59.461
Are they fighting, or just fooling around?

04:59.791 --> 05:00.821
Beats me.

05:08.601 --> 05:09.801
This isn't good.

05:10.141 --> 05:12.111
The security is much tighter.

05:12.741 --> 05:16.701
I assumed this would be my chance
with Guan-Coo at the stadium.

05:17.981 --> 05:19.381
However...

05:20.311 --> 05:22.441
...if I successfully rescue her...

05:23.921 --> 05:25.351
...Maiko would...

05:27.491 --> 05:30.181
Daisuke! You're marvelous!

05:31.931 --> 05:35.461
- I love you, my sweet darling!
- Stop it, you're embarrassing me.

05:35.461 --> 05:36.721
I only did what was right.

05:37.301 --> 05:40.291
Oh, I am so happy!

05:43.071 --> 05:45.541
I'll do it, my sweet honey!

05:45.541 --> 05:47.531
I'll do it for you, Maiko Yukino!

05:51.311 --> 05:53.111
Let's go, Kanper!

06:04.661 --> 06:07.351
What an obstinate and distasteful person.

06:22.581 --> 06:23.941
R-Rockaku.

06:23.941 --> 06:25.311
Who goes next?

06:25.311 --> 06:26.781
You go ahead.

06:27.181 --> 06:28.881
Go and quickly brush them away.

06:29.221 --> 06:30.771
C-Come on.

06:31.151 --> 06:33.421
If you're struggling against guys like them...

06:33.421 --> 06:35.061
...you'll never become the champion.

06:35.061 --> 06:37.461
B-But it's a team match...

06:37.521 --> 06:39.651
...and Kyoji's really strong.

06:40.091 --> 06:41.721
That guy's strong?

06:41.831 --> 06:42.821
Yes.

06:43.031 --> 06:45.401
He was even a Dragon Drive champion.

06:45.831 --> 06:47.701
Yeah, he's strong.

06:47.801 --> 06:52.971
Are you thinking you could lose this match,
before it's even begun?

06:53.141 --> 06:54.941
Well, not exactly, but if...

06:56.081 --> 06:59.051
Then stop whining and go beat 'em up!

06:59.051 --> 07:00.571
We're here to protect the Dragonite, right?!

07:02.021 --> 07:03.851
Y-Yeah.

07:04.121 --> 07:06.021
Are you finished chatting?

07:08.261 --> 07:09.591
Here I go, Reiji!

07:09.591 --> 07:11.161
I've been waiting for this moment...

07:11.161 --> 07:13.181
...to fight you.

07:21.501 --> 07:22.491
Reiji.

07:22.941 --> 07:25.771
I need you to get much, much stronger.

07:27.271 --> 07:28.611
Otherwise...

07:30.111 --> 07:32.941
...we'll never make it to that kid's level!

07:39.191 --> 07:40.651
I'm counting on you, Kanper!

07:42.491 --> 07:44.691
There's an intruder!

07:44.691 --> 07:47.091
- Capture the intruder!
- Oh, no!

07:47.091 --> 07:49.861
A-At this rate, I'll never make it to her cell.

07:51.261 --> 07:54.101
Wh-What am I gonna do?!

07:59.241 --> 08:00.341
Kyoji!

08:00.341 --> 08:02.311
What are you doing here in Rikyu?!

08:02.611 --> 08:03.871
It's your fault.

08:05.481 --> 08:08.851
Searching for you led me to this stage.

08:09.421 --> 08:10.951
That's all.

08:10.951 --> 08:12.581
Stage?

08:12.891 --> 08:14.791
This isn't a game, you know!

08:15.261 --> 08:17.191
To me, it's all the same.

08:21.461 --> 08:22.831
H-He's strong.

08:29.601 --> 08:30.801
I won't be defeated!

08:31.041 --> 08:32.831
That's good, Reiji!

08:50.391 --> 08:51.551
What in the world?

08:57.231 --> 08:58.221
Ch-Chibi!

08:58.771 --> 09:01.701
Well, what'll you do now, Reiji?

09:04.871 --> 09:07.701
Wh-What is this attack?!

09:17.951 --> 09:19.351
This is pathetic.

09:19.351 --> 09:22.321
Maiko and Reiji are out there fighting, yet...

09:22.321 --> 09:26.761
- This'll teach him!
- Let me have a shot at him!

09:31.361 --> 09:32.351
I...

09:32.831 --> 09:34.321
I will not lose!

09:35.041 --> 09:38.661
This is my own Dragonic Heaven!

09:46.451 --> 09:48.111
Game over already?

09:48.551 --> 09:51.111
Please do not betray
my expectations of you.

09:51.951 --> 09:55.121
I've fought against all kinds of people
here in Rikyu.

09:55.391 --> 09:57.451
Bad guys and good guys!

09:57.721 --> 09:59.421
But it was never just for play!

09:59.661 --> 10:00.921
Everyone was desperate!

10:01.261 --> 10:02.661
Everyone fought seriously!

10:05.071 --> 10:08.641
And I can't afford to lose...

10:08.641 --> 10:10.871
...if I'm going to find
my own answer to all this!

10:31.321 --> 10:33.691
What's this incredible power?

10:40.931 --> 10:42.201
I see!

10:42.541 --> 10:45.271
You absorb everything
as if it's all happening to you...

10:45.271 --> 10:47.301
...and grow as a result.

10:47.771 --> 10:50.471
That ability may be the source
of the power within you.

10:52.551 --> 10:53.811
I wanna know more!

10:55.721 --> 10:56.811
Kyoji!

10:57.151 --> 10:58.741
Wh-What the?

11:02.461 --> 11:06.951
I've become curious
about what you're trying to achieve here!

11:07.761 --> 11:09.521
I've decided to watch and see how you do!

11:09.761 --> 11:10.961
That's enough!

11:10.961 --> 11:12.431
Stand back, Kyoji!

11:12.731 --> 11:14.701
I no longer have any use for you!

11:14.731 --> 11:15.721
Oh, my.

11:16.141 --> 11:17.541
Have I upset you?

11:17.541 --> 11:20.511
I was never counting on you
in the first place!

11:21.271 --> 11:24.271
I'll do what I must to get my hands
on the Dragonite, all on my own!

11:50.071 --> 11:53.401
You should feel honored
to be able to fight me!

11:53.641 --> 11:55.281
It doesn't matter who I'm fighting.

11:55.281 --> 11:57.581
I must continue winning!

11:57.581 --> 11:58.841
Here I come!

12:01.781 --> 12:03.011
It's fast!

12:03.181 --> 12:04.281
Right there!

12:27.071 --> 12:28.781
Wh-Why is it?

12:28.781 --> 12:31.471
Why is that dragon recovering so quickly?

12:34.251 --> 12:35.941
The Dragonite is mine!

12:36.281 --> 12:37.411
I won't let anyone else get it!

12:37.651 --> 12:39.281
I cannot let anyone else get it!

12:39.751 --> 12:41.911
The Dragonite is yours, you say?

12:42.391 --> 12:43.861
Why's that?!

12:50.831 --> 12:53.391
Damn you, Guan-Coo!

13:04.081 --> 13:05.911
Wh-Why, this is...

13:11.751 --> 13:15.761
If you want your mother back,
get the Dragonite.

13:15.761 --> 13:18.021
So says Mr. Guan-Coo.

13:18.731 --> 13:19.751
Mother!

13:19.961 --> 13:20.951
Mukai!

13:21.331 --> 13:22.661
Guan-Coo!

13:22.661 --> 13:24.251
Just make sure you keep your promise!

13:29.801 --> 13:31.271
I will not be defeated.

13:32.441 --> 13:34.071
I cannot allow myself to be defeated!

13:43.151 --> 13:44.121
Mukai.

13:44.751 --> 13:46.341
What is it with this guy?!

13:48.691 --> 13:52.991
Looks like you've lit a fire
within Mukai, Reiji.

13:55.131 --> 13:56.501
Boy.

13:56.501 --> 13:58.621
Getting all fired up like that.

13:58.901 --> 14:00.491
What a simple guy.

14:00.901 --> 14:02.461
Who do you think will win?

14:03.241 --> 14:04.761
Reiji Ohzora will win.

14:05.341 --> 14:06.601
You wanna bet on it?

14:08.981 --> 14:11.071
Well, not that I care who wins.

14:13.281 --> 14:15.011
Where is she?

14:15.011 --> 14:17.811
Where could that person be?

14:19.451 --> 14:21.821
I know he's here somewhere!

14:22.021 --> 14:23.011
That bastard!

14:28.931 --> 14:30.901
He will make an appearance.

14:31.261 --> 14:32.751
Just wait, Yakou.

14:33.231 --> 14:35.001
I'll avenge your death!

14:42.841 --> 14:46.381
That machine's not gonna tell you
how things are in Rikyu.

14:46.381 --> 14:47.281
S!

14:47.811 --> 14:49.341
What are you trying to do, L?

14:50.051 --> 14:52.451
You know what could happen to you
if they caught you doing this.

14:52.921 --> 14:53.911
Nothing.

14:54.321 --> 14:55.981
I just wanted to know how things were.

14:56.691 --> 14:58.381
I don't plan to do anything.

14:59.091 --> 15:01.581
Then I don't have a problem.

15:06.831 --> 15:08.601
You can't fool me.

15:08.601 --> 15:10.501
Not with such lame excuses.

15:11.501 --> 15:12.441
This way!

15:12.441 --> 15:14.341
- He went this way!
- Don't let him get away!

15:21.611 --> 15:23.341
Is this the end?!

15:37.101 --> 15:38.531
Thank you, Kanper!

15:39.671 --> 15:42.231
- Hey! He's getting away!
- Get him!

15:51.511 --> 15:52.481
Guan-Coo!

15:53.251 --> 15:55.271
Don't forget your promise!

15:55.921 --> 15:58.781
I'll be sure to get you the Dragonite!

15:59.091 --> 16:00.191
What?!

16:00.191 --> 16:03.181
Why in the world are you giving
that bastard Guan-Coo a hand?!

16:03.321 --> 16:05.631
It's none of your business!

16:05.631 --> 16:08.121
I will defeat you and become victorious!

16:08.361 --> 16:09.451
That's all!

16:16.541 --> 16:19.741
I don't know what's going on
between you and him...

16:19.741 --> 16:21.301
...but Guan-Coo isn't getting the Dragonite!

16:26.151 --> 16:27.131
I...

16:27.551 --> 16:28.241
I...

16:29.751 --> 16:32.551
I can't afford to lose, either!

16:35.861 --> 16:36.821
Excuse me!

16:37.061 --> 16:38.961
Is anybody here?

16:39.661 --> 16:42.251
If so, please say something!

16:55.211 --> 16:56.511
I will not be defeated!

16:56.881 --> 16:58.431
I cannot be defeated!

17:09.361 --> 17:11.221
U-Uh...

17:11.661 --> 17:13.561
...a- are you all right?

17:13.831 --> 17:15.561
We'd better hurry and get you outta here.

17:22.971 --> 17:24.701
A-Are you okay?!

17:24.741 --> 17:27.071
I've come here to save you!

17:27.111 --> 17:28.701
We'll escape from this place together!

17:39.621 --> 17:41.211
Do you still plan to fight?!

17:41.421 --> 17:43.721
We can end this if you just admit defeat!

17:43.721 --> 17:44.661
What?!

17:45.991 --> 17:48.091
I'm getting sick and tired of your face.

17:48.761 --> 17:50.251
I think I'll put an end to this!

17:58.471 --> 18:02.171
No matter how much I attack,
that guy's injuries heal in no time!

18:02.641 --> 18:05.081
Then I've got no choice
but to attack the same spot...

18:05.081 --> 18:07.711
...over and over again
before it has a chance to heal!

18:09.581 --> 18:10.571
Come on!

18:10.851 --> 18:12.321
Hang in there!

18:12.321 --> 18:13.551
We've got to escape together!

18:13.991 --> 18:15.721
Hey! Hey!

18:17.421 --> 18:18.291
T-Take this.

18:19.791 --> 18:23.021
Please. Give it to that child.

18:24.931 --> 18:27.301
I beg you... please.

18:32.411 --> 18:33.541
H-Hey!

18:33.541 --> 18:34.671
Come on!

18:34.671 --> 18:35.301
Hey!

18:35.811 --> 18:37.301
I'm talking to you!

18:37.941 --> 18:38.841
Mukai.

18:55.601 --> 18:56.331
Hey!

18:56.331 --> 18:57.561
Wake up!

18:57.561 --> 18:58.361
Please!

18:58.361 --> 18:59.331
Come on!

18:59.331 --> 19:01.831
No! Don't die on me!

19:01.831 --> 19:03.531
Say something!

19:09.041 --> 19:10.031
Who?

19:11.211 --> 19:15.611
Who am I supposed to give this to?!

19:19.291 --> 19:21.381
I will... not be defeated!

19:22.161 --> 19:23.621
I cannot be defeated!

19:32.301 --> 19:34.321
Wh-What's wrong, Shadow Fang?

19:34.831 --> 19:36.131
We can't lose!

19:36.441 --> 19:38.231
I must win this bout!

19:39.741 --> 19:41.931
This'll end it!

19:45.481 --> 19:46.951
I won't lose!

19:46.951 --> 19:47.941
I...

19:48.351 --> 19:49.341
I...

19:50.851 --> 19:51.841
Mukai.

19:52.691 --> 19:54.521
Please stop fighting.

19:55.091 --> 19:56.421
Mother.

19:57.291 --> 19:58.521
Why is that?

19:58.961 --> 19:59.951
Why?

20:01.731 --> 20:03.351
That cannot be.

20:06.531 --> 20:07.831
Mother!

20:19.881 --> 20:20.871
Game over.

20:21.211 --> 20:23.441
- All right!
- That was amazing!

20:30.191 --> 20:31.421
Mother.

20:34.231 --> 20:35.991
What a great match.

20:36.331 --> 20:39.321
Let's be sure to get just as fired up
during our match.

20:40.001 --> 20:41.171
Just kidding.

20:41.171 --> 20:42.761
That battle was nothing.

20:43.971 --> 20:45.341
Are you all right, Reiji?

20:45.771 --> 20:47.241
You did awesome, Reiji!

20:49.381 --> 20:51.971
You didn't need to get
so steamed up out there.

20:52.311 --> 20:54.141
You're just making more work for me.

20:54.311 --> 20:55.371
Let's see.

20:55.581 --> 20:58.711
Now I need an alternate plan.

20:59.191 --> 21:00.171
Kyoji!

21:00.591 --> 21:03.251
I don't want to talk right now.

21:05.731 --> 21:07.091
Don't worry about him.

21:07.091 --> 21:11.291
Everyone participating in Dragonic Heaven
is prepared for the worst.

21:11.501 --> 21:14.591
You won't get far in the tournament
if you worry about the losers.

21:14.931 --> 21:16.031
That's true, but...

21:16.341 --> 21:17.731
...I'm a bit concerned about that guy.

21:17.941 --> 21:19.171
Don't get all mushy.

21:19.671 --> 21:21.731
You know who your next opponent is!

21:26.311 --> 21:27.401
Taiyou!

21:28.281 --> 21:31.611
I will be sure to protect the Dragonite,
no matter what.

21:32.291 --> 21:35.721
If that's what I must do
for the good of this world...

21:35.721 --> 21:37.451
...then I will, for sure!

21:57.081 --> 21:59.811
taikutsu datta
I was bored

21:59.811 --> 22:02.581
okubyou datta
I was a coward

22:02.581 --> 22:06.541
dareka wo jibun wo kizutsukete ita
I was hurting someone and myself

22:07.991 --> 22:10.761
tsuyogari itte
I tried to hide my weakness

22:10.761 --> 22:12.951
wagamama itte
I was being selfish

22:13.391 --> 22:17.521
doushiyoumonai kimochi mamoritsuzukete
Protecting the uncontrollable feeling

22:18.931 --> 22:21.601
otona ni natte
I became an adult

22:21.601 --> 22:24.341
kimi to deatte
Then I met you

22:24.341 --> 22:28.331
mune no sumikko yawarakaku natte
My heart got softened

22:29.641 --> 22:32.141
setsunaku natta
Longing for love

22:32.141 --> 22:35.151
dakishime atta
We embraced each other

22:35.151 --> 22:40.051
hakkiri mamorubeki mono wo mitsuketa
I finally knew what I wanted to protect

22:40.691 --> 22:43.421
tatta hitotsu no yuuki ga
Only one courage

22:43.421 --> 22:46.191
tatta hitotsu no kotoba ga
Just one word

22:46.191 --> 22:50.861
futari owaranai yume e to hakobu
Take us to an endless dream

22:51.561 --> 22:54.331
hon no chiisana yasashisa ga
Only a small kindness

22:54.331 --> 22:57.001
hon no wazuka na sasayaki ga
Only a small whisper

22:57.001 --> 23:01.671
futari wo sotto tsutsunde kureru
Wrap us gently

23:02.311 --> 23:06.841
zutto konomama asa ga kurumade
Until the morning comes

23:07.751 --> 23:13.451
zutto konomama asa ga kurumade
Until the morning comes

23:15.721 --> 23:18.421
Next Episode

23:18.791 --> 23:19.961
Finally appearing!

23:19.961 --> 23:22.701
Defending champion of the Dragonic Heaven,
Sun Wols, a. k.a. Taiyou!

23:22.701 --> 23:23.601
Sun Wols!

23:23.601 --> 23:26.861
The time has come for him
to display his skills!

23:27.201 --> 23:27.901
Huh?

23:27.901 --> 23:32.141
Why are Hikaru Himuro and Ichirou Sumishiba
on the opposing team?

23:32.141 --> 23:33.611
What are they doing in Rikyu?!

23:34.171 --> 23:36.711
